<title>USA: ESS Technology sets stock buyback.</title>
<headline>ESS Technology sets stock buyback.</headline>
<dateline>FREMONT, Calif. 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>ESS Technology Inc said Tuesday its board had set a stock buyback of up to two million shares.</p>
<p>ESS also said it would issue 2.54 million shares as part of a plan to purchase Platform Technologies Inc. Previously, the company had planned to use a pooling of interests method of accounting to merge with Platform Tech.</p>
<p>ESS develops personal computer audio and digital video semiconductor software.</p>
